<![CDATA[<span class="ui-provider bvg bvh bhg bvi bvj bvk bvl bvm bvn bvo bvp bvq bvr bvs bvt bvu bvv bvw bvx bvy bvz bwa bwb bwc bwd bwe bwf bwg bwh bwi bwj bwk bwl bwm bwn" dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hi,</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p></span><span class="ui-provider bvg bvh bhg bvi bvj bvk bvl bvm bvn bvo bvp bvq bvr bvs bvt bvu bvv bvw bvx bvy bvz bwa bwb bwc bwd bwe bwf bwg bwh bwi bwj bwk bwl bwm bwn" dir="ltr" style=""><p style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Please be informed that the Energy Use record </span></font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!StnryAssetEnrgyUse.Name}&nbsp;</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">for the site&nbsp;</span><font face="arial"><b>{!StnryAssetEnrgyUse.SiteInfo_Name__c} </b>for the </font><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>{!StnryAssetEnrgyUse.NZC_Month__c} </b>month&nbsp;</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">has been </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Rejected&nbsp;</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">with the comments<b>&nbsp;</b></span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>{!ApprovalRequest.Comments}.&nbsp;</b>The</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;Data Processor will review the record</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">, perform necessary updates and manually send for approval by using button Submit for Approval.</span></p></span><span class="ui-provider bvg bvh bhg bvi bvj bvk bvl bvm bvn bvo bvp bvq bvr bvs bvt bvu bvv bvw bvx bvy bvz bwa bwb bwc bwd bwe bwf bwg bwh bwi bwj bwk bwl bwm bwn" dir="ltr" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span class="ui-provider ef azx azy azz baa bab bac bae baf bag bah bai baj bak bal bam ban bao bap baq bar bas bat bau bav baw bax bay baz bba bbb bbc bbd bbe bbf" dir="ltr"></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please click on the below link to open the record.</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 18px; color: rgb(58, 58, 58); font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;">{!StnryAssetEnrgyUse.Link}</span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!StnryAssetEnrgyUse.LastModifiedBy}</font></p></span><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
